// Villagers of Brigodunon. Short talk that tracks the main quest.
=== start
[quest hostages=reported] -> late
[quest hostages=summoned] -> early
"They say you're going after the hostages. Is it true?"
* "It's true." -> true
* "Who says?" -> who

=== early
"Vellaunos is looking for you. Everybody knows it except you, apparently."
* "Thanks." -> END

=== true
"Then good luck. My cousin's girl was nearly the one they took, instead of Ateula. Nearly." They make a sign against bad luck. "Don't tell anyone I said so."
* "I won't." -> END

=== who
"Everyone. It's Brigodunon. Somebody sneezes at one end of the village and they're saying 'gods bless you' at the other."
* "Fair." -> END

=== late
"Noviodunum, is it? Where's that, then?"
* "North. A long way north." -> END
